  "notes": "Story order follows the in-universe (BBY/ABY) timeline as listed by Tom's Guide, matching Disney+'s chronological order for the films. The Clone Wars (2008) film is optional: it is the animated pilot of the series rather than a saga film, so the end card after Attack of the Clones offers Revenge of the Sith; it sits just before the series in the story order. The Mandalorian and Grogu (2026) follows the series it continues, after Ahsoka (all around 9 ABY). Series are optional, one entry each. Left out: Resistance, Tales of the Jedi / Empire / Underworld, Visions (anthologies or non-canon), the Holiday Special and Ewok films."
